o Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic001791-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic001791_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic001791_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic001791_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic001791_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text based on autopsy</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>As Orsi observed, the piece is surely a fragment of a funerary inscription, and most likely the beginnings of two names, with the second likely to be the patronymic.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Orsi 1900 50 no.18 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001707\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001707</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Elegant thinly incised letters of very wide square module, and without serifs. Alpha broad with straight bar; four-bar sigma, with slightly open upper and lower strokes.</p> Line 1-2  40-43  Interlineation line 1 to 2  2-3  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
